      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}:\nLooks like it's mostly noticeable on Desktop. \nIt seems like each avatar has different intensity of jitter for some reason.\nOn Desktop it seems to mostly jitter two legs, chest and arms.\nI tried few times in VR but it feels like it might be jittering in the way that is hard to notice.\nTesting between VR and Desktop had an idea blink through my mind that maybe jitter is somehow affecting areas of an avatar in between points that don't have a tracking device?\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D5pXrKtsUBc",
