  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The Foot IK that kicks in after standing still for 3 seconds causes avatars to jitter on open-beta at a big intensity, regardless of the distance between you and the origin.\nThe longer you stand in the same place the smaller jitter becomes over-time.\n1. Grab VRCSDK3 avatar\n2. Look at your body while standing still for 3 seconds\n3. *Jitter*\n4. Wait about 30+ seconds\n5. *Jitter is still there but it's way smaller comparatively to when it started*\nDoes not seem to occur on Live.\nDoes not seem to occur with VRCSDK2 avatars.",
